s it's on us  we as good as much as we like our guys  in the back  they can't handle all of those receivers  so we've got to get pressure the other  side of the the game plan is pretty  simple this is gonna be the run pass  options Nick Foles is gonna read it and  he's got to throw when that's available  and probably most of the time it is  gonna be throw because I'm sure New  England's gonna take away the run so  Foles has to be efficient not to turn  the ball over and the defensive line has  to press to the pass I think New  England's gonna throw 55 yeah I do too  it's good but I think it's gonna be no  huddle  I think Brady's gonna have tempo there  and not let them substitute and that's  okay they're fine not substituting if  they can get pressure explain to me what  this  means to you the Pat Summerall Ward that  you're gonna get Thursday night the  dinner benefiting st. Jude Children's  Research Hospital Pat Summerall was  legendary in this business just a guy  who was class and longevity and doing  things the right way and to ask to be  honored and over the course of your  career doing things the right way and  doing things for the community it's  gonna be be pretty awesome and to be  here in the town where I went to school  I coached as an assistant coach a lot of  my formative years were here it couldn't  have been better timing well well did  well deserved as well humming you know  but you know you're getting all these  awards and then we have to call you a  Hall of Famer we can't I can't say Tony  [Laughter]  there's always a title that goes with  you that's hard I mean it's you know I  have to catch myself because when I say  hey Tony and then you don't turn around  ago Hall of Famer where's the bus that  I'm going on you're right thanks great  hall-of-famer  he's NBC football night in America now  getting another award here Continental  Tire coaches corner with Tony Dungy for  more Dan Patrick show to the audience  Channel 239 on DirecTV or download the